0%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신규사업 기획 및 홍보 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(2) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지역본부 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">8</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개 지역별 모집 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">서울</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전주</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">광주</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">부산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">제주</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지역별 대학생 교육기부 사업 운영 및 참여 대학생 모집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">관리</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지역별 대학생 교육기부 커뮤니티 활성화 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">포럼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">/</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">워크숍 개최</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">소모임 개설 및 운영 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">○ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">특 전 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">임명장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">수료증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교육기부 활동확인서 증서</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교육부에서 주관하는 교육기부 사업참여 기회 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">관련 활동에 대한 봉사시간 부여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">활동비 일부 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전국적 인재 네트워크 형성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">역량강화 프로그램 제공 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">담당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국과학창의재단 교육기부자유학기지원실 노성찬 연구원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(02-559-3946, rsc@kofac.re.kr)</span></p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
